  <name>Continuum IDE</name>
  <summary>Desktop IDE for coding agents</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.swashxdev">
    <name>Continuum IDE contributors</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Continuum IDE is an open-source desktop app for coding agents. Use the
      agent subscriptions you already have, switch between agents and accounts
      without losing context, review changes, and run commands in your projects.
    </p>
    <p>
      Continuum IDE is a community fork of T3 Code by T3 Tools Inc. and is not
      an official T3 Code release.
    </p>
  </description>
